# The repo root ignores Cargo.lock and bin/. Both are wrong for a binary
# crate: the lockfile is what makes a build reproducible, and src/bin/ holds
# the measurement probe.
!Cargo.lock
!src/bin/

# Model payload. 225 MB of weights does not belong in a repo whose binary is
# 2.7 MB, and everyone cloning would pay for it whether or not they build the
# speech engine. The bundle's NOTICE, SHA256SUMS and scripts stay tracked, so
# what is published is reviewable even though the payload is not -- see
# assets/README.md for repopulating a fresh clone.
assets/**/*.safetensors
assets/**/tokenizer.model

# Documentation and packaging build output
site/
book/
dist/

